OL,3,GNEWSALong queues as wire damage
OL,4,Adisrupts train services
OL,5,
OL,6,FRailway journeys between York,
OL,7,FMiddlesbrough and Darlington have been
OL,8,Fhit by severe delays and cancellations
OL,9,Fdue to damaged overhead wires, National
OL,10,FRail has said.
OL,12,FThe damage, which caused signalling
OL,13,Fproblems in the Northallerton area,
OL,14,Falso meant some services were likely to
OL,15,Fbe "revised", with the issue expected
OL,16,Fto continue until the end of Tuesday, a
OL,17,Fspokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
