OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSALong queues as wire damage
OL,4,Adisrupts train services
OL,5,
OL,6,FLong queues of passengers built up at
OL,7,FYork Station during the afternoon and
OL,8,Fevening, with rail replacement buses
OL,9,Flaid on to get people to their
OL,10,Fdestinations.
OL,12,FFootage seen by the BBC showed a long
OL,13,Fline of people snaking from the York
OL,14,FTap pub on one side of the station to
OL,15,Fbus stops on the other side of the
OL,16,Fstation's taxi rank.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
